 within NZ, with discreet packaging and cold-chain handling to preserve peptide integrity.</p>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n</a>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3: Best Sellers -->\n<h2>Best sellers</h2>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n    Explore All\n</a>\n\n<h5>BPC-157 10mg</h5>\n<h5>CJC-1295 NO DAC\n+ Ipamorelin</h5>\n<h5>NAD+ 500mg</h5>\n<h5>Retatrutide 10mg</h5>\n<h5>BPC-157 10mg</h5>\n<h5>CJC-1295 NO DAC\n+ Ipamorelin</h5>\n<h5>NAD+ 500mg</h5>\n<h5>Retatrutide 10mg</h5>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4: Quote Banner -->\n<h3>Unlock your body\'s potential — backed by science, built for results.</h3>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n    Shop Now\n</a>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5: Shop by Category -->\n<h2>Shop by category</h2>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n    Explore All\n</a>\n\n<h3>Recovery</h3>\n<a href=\"/product-category/recovery/\">\n    Shop Now\n</a>\n\n<h3>Longevity</h3>\n<a href=\"/product-category/longevity/\">\n    Shop Now\n</a>\n\n<!-- SECTION 6: Featured Products -->\n<h2>Featured products</h2>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n    Explore All\n</a>\n\n<!-- SECTION 7: Newsletter / CTA -->\n<h2>New Peptides Dropping Soon</h2>\n<p>We\'re constantly expanding our catalogue with the latest research compounds. Sign up to get early access to new releases, restocks, and exclusive offers for NZ researchers.</p>\n<a href=\"/shop/\">\n    Shop Now\n</a>\n\n<!-- SECTION 8: FAQ -->\n<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n\n<button id=\"ui-e-tab-title-1871\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab-index=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"ui-e-tab-content-1871\" style=\"--ui-e-tabs-order: 1;\">\n    General Questions\n</button>\n<button id=\"ui-e-tab-title-1872\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab-index=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ui-e-tab-content-1872\" style=\"--ui-e-tabs-order: 2;\">\n    Orders &amp; Shipping\n</button>\n<button id=\"ui-e-tab-title-1873\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab-index=\"3\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ui-e-tab-content-1873\" style=\"--ui-e-tabs-order: 3;\">\n    Returns &amp; Refunds\n</button>\n<button id=\"ui-e-tab-title-1874\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab-index=\"4\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ui-e-tab-content-1874\" style=\"--ui-e-tabs-order: 4;\">\n    Product &amp; Quality\n</button>\n\n<!-- Tab 1: General Questions -->\n<h5>\n    What are research peptides?\n</h5>\nPeptides are short chains of amino acids that play key roles in biological processes. Our peptides are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption.\n\n<h5>\n    Are your peptides third-party tested?\n</h5>\n<p>Yes. Every batch is independently tested for purity (minimum 98%) and identity via HPLC and mass spectrometry. Certificates of analysis are available on request.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    Do you ship throughout New Zealand?\n</h5>\nWe offer fast, discreet shipping across all of New Zealand. Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days with tracked courier delivery.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you offer volume discounts?\n</h5>\nYes. Orders of 2+ items receive 10% off, and 3+ items receive 15% off automatically at checkout.\n\n<h5>\n    How should I store my peptides?\n</h5>\nPeptides should be stored in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. For long-term storage, keep them refrigerated at 2–8°C. Reconstituted peptides should be refrigerated and used within 30 days.\n\n<!-- Tab 2: Orders & Shipping -->\n<h5>\n    How long does shipping take?\n</h5>\n<p>Most orders arrive within 1–3 business days within New Zealand. You will receive a tracking number via email once your order is dispatched.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    Do you offer express shipping?\n</h5>\nYes, express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses.\n\n<h5>\n    Can I track my order?\n</h5>\nAbsolutely. A tracking link is emailed to you as soon as your order ships. You can also check your order status in your account dashboard.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you ship internationally?\n</h5>\nCurrently we only ship within New Zealand. International shipping is being evaluated for future release.\n\n<!-- Tab 3: Returns & Refunds -->\n<h5>\n    What is your return policy?\n</h5>\nDue to the nature of research compounds, we cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products. Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund.\n\n<h5>\n    What if my order arrives damaged?\n</h5>\n<p>Contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no extra cost.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    How long do refunds take?\n</h5>\nRefunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product.\n\n<!-- Tab 4: Product & Quality -->\n<h5>\n    What purity are your peptides?\n</h5>\nAll Eterna Labs peptides are a minimum of 98% purity, verified by independent HPLC testing.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you provide Certificates of Analysis?\n</h5>\n<p>Yes. COAs are available for every batch. Contact us with your order number and we will send the relevant certificate.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    What is bacteriostatic water used for?\n</h5>\nBacteriostatic water (BAC water) is sterile water containing 0.9% benzyl alcohol. It is used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides for research purposes.\n\n<h5>\n    Are your products for human consumption?\n</h5>\nNo. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.\n\n<!-- Duplicate FAQ tabs (matches original template structure) -->\n<h5>\n    What are research peptides?\n</h5>\nPeptides are short chains of amino acids that play key roles in biological processes. Our peptides are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption.\n\n<h5>\n    Are your peptides third-party tested?\n</h5>\n<p>Yes. Every batch is independently tested for purity (minimum 98%) and identity via HPLC and mass spectrometry. Certificates of analysis are available on request.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    Do you ship throughout New Zealand?\n</h5>\nWe offer fast, discreet shipping across all of New Zealand. Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days with tracked courier delivery.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you offer volume discounts?\n</h5>\nYes. Orders of 2+ items receive 10% off, and 3+ items receive 15% off automatically at checkout.\n\n<h5>\n    How should I store my peptides?\n</h5>\nPeptides should be stored in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. For long-term storage, keep them refrigerated at 2–8°C. Reconstituted peptides should be refrigerated and used within 30 days.\n\n<h5>\n    How long does shipping take?\n</h5>\n<p>Most orders arrive within 1–3 business days within New Zealand. You will receive a tracking number via email once your order is dispatched.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    Do you offer express shipping?\n</h5>\nYes, express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses.\n\n<h5>\n    Can I track my order?\n</h5>\nAbsolutely. A tracking link is emailed to you as soon as your order ships. You can also check your order status in your account dashboard.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you ship internationally?\n</h5>\nCurrently we only ship within New Zealand. International shipping is being evaluated for future release.\n\n<h5>\n    What is your return policy?\n</h5>\nDue to the nature of research compounds, we cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products. Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund.\n\n<h5>\n    What if my order arrives damaged?\n</h5>\n<p>Contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no extra cost.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    How long do refunds take?\n</h5>\nRefunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product.\n\n<h5>\n    What purity are your peptides?\n</h5>\nAll Eterna Labs peptides are a minimum of 98% purity, verified by independent HPLC testing.\n\n<h5>\n    Do you provide Certificates of Analysis?\n</h5>\n<p>Yes. COAs are available for every batch. Contact us with your order number and we will send the relevant certificate.</p>\n\n<h5>\n    What is bacteriostatic water used for?\n</h5>\nBacteriostatic water (BAC water) is sterile water containing 0.9% benzyl alcohol. It is used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides for research purposes.\n\n<h5>\n    Are your products for human consumption?\n</h5>\nNo. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.\n','Velvet','','inherit','closed','closed','','67-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 00:30:30','2026-03-12 12:30:30','',67,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=163',0,'revision','',0),(164,1,'2026-03-13 00:31:24','2026-03-12 12:31:24','<h2>A premier fashion destination for style enthusiasts</h2>		<p>Designed with the modern adventurer in mind, our products offer unmatched comfort, durability, and versatility, helping you go further with less.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Choose the best everyday wear!</h2>		<p>Located in Salt Lake City, Utah, Pa\'lante Packs specializes in creating ultralight<br />bags and gear designed for thru-hiking and various outdoor activities.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2