026-03-12 21:41:30','','FAQs','','publish','closed','closed','','faqs','','','2026-03-13 09:41:30','2026-03-12 21:41:30','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/faqs/',0,'page','',0),(232,1,'2026-03-13 09:41:38','2026-03-12 21:41:38','<h2>Our Mission</h2>		<p>Eterna Labs was founded with a simple goal: make premium research peptides accessible to New Zealand researchers. Every product we stock is sourced from GMP-certified facilities, independently tested for purity and potency, and shipped with cold-chain integrity so it arrives exactly as it should.</p>			<h2>Our Promise</h2>		<p>We believe transparency builds trust. That\'s why every batch comes with third-party testing, every order ships with tracked delivery, and our team is always available to answer your questions. No shortcuts, no compromises.</p>			<h2>Why researchers choose us</h2>		<p>There exists a place that transforms smiles into works of art, and that place is Verma Dental Care. The story begins with a dentist.</p>			\n                <h4>(01)</h4> 98%+ Purity \n                    <p>Every batch independently verified via HPLC and mass spectrometry testing. Certificates of analysis available on request.</p>                \n                <h4>(02)</h4> Fast NZ Shipping \n                    <p>Dispatched within 1–2 business days with tracked courier delivery to anywhere in New Zealand.</p>                \n                <h4>(03)</h4> Cold-Chain Handling \n                    <p>Temperature-sensitive products shipped with proper cold-chain protocols to preserve peptide integrity.</p>                \n                <h4>(04)</h4> Volume Discounts \n                    <p>Save 10% on 2+ items and 15% on 3+ items — applied automatically at checkout. No codes needed.</p>                \n					<h4>Step 01</h4>					<h3>Sourced</h3>		<p>From GMP-certified facilities with strict quality controls</p>			<h4>Step 02</h4>					<h3>Tested</h3>		<p>Independent HPLC and mass spectrometry verification</p>			<h4>Step 03</h4>					<h3>Delivered\n</h3>		<p>Cold-chain shipped with tracked courier across NZ</p>			<h2>Ready to explore our range?</h2>		<p>Browse our full catalogue of research-grade peptides and accessories.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n									Shop\n					</a>','About Eterna Labs','','publish','closed','closed','','about','','','2026-03-13 10:55:28','2026-03-12 22:55:28','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/about/',0,'page','',0),(234,1,'2026-03-13 10:04:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00',' ','','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-03-13 10:04:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=234',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(235,1,'2026-03-13 10:04:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00',' ','','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-03-13 10:04:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=235',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(236,1,'2026-03-13 10:13:15','2026-03-12 22:13:15','<h6>- Contact</h6>					<h2>We\'re Here to Help</h2>					\n        <form method=\"post\" name=\"New Form\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"post_id\" value=\"236\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"widget_type\" value=\"contact-form\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"required_fields_message\" value=\"Fill all required fields.\">\n                                                    <label for=\"form-field-name\">\n                                First Name                            </label>\n                                                            <input size=\"1\" type=\"text\" name=\"form_fields[name]\" id=\"form-field-name\" placeholder=\"John\" required=\"required\" aria-required=\"true\">\n                                                    <label for=\"form-field-field_ds6lmux\">\n                                Last Name                            </label>\n                                                            <input size=\"1\" type=\"text\" name=\"form_fields[field_ds6lmux]\" id=\"form-field-field_ds6lmux\" placeholder=\"Doe\" required=\"required\" aria-required=\"true\">\n                                                    <label for=\"form-field-email\">\n                                Email                            </label>\n                                                            <input size=\"1\" type=\"email\" name=\"form_fields[email]\" id=\"form-field-email\" placeholder=\"johndoe@gmail.com\" required=\"required\" aria-required=\"true\">\n                                                    <label for=\"form-field-field_hzgo3bk\">\n                                Phone Number                            </label>\n                                                            <input size=\"1\" type=\"tel\" name=\"form_fields[field_hzgo3bk]\" id=\"form-field-field_hzgo3bk\" placeholder=\"021 345 678\" required=\"required\" aria-required=\"true\">\n                                                    <label for=\"form-field-message\">\n                                Message                            </label>\n                            <textarea name=\"form_fields[message]\" id=\"form-field-message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Enter your message here...\" required=\"required\" aria-required=\"true\"></textarea>                    \n                    <button type=\"submit\">\n                                                                                        Submit\n                    </button>\n        </form>\n					<h6>- faqs</h6>					<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>				\n                    <h3>\n                                                        What purity are your peptides?                        \n                    </h3>\n                        <p>All Eterna Labs peptides are a minimum of 98% purity, verified by independent HPLC testing.</p>                    \n                    <h3>\n                                                        Are your products for human consumption?                        \n                    </h3>\n                        <p>No. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved<br />for human consumption.</p>                    \n                    <h3>\n                                                        How should I store my peptides?                        \n                    </h3>\n                        <p>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. For long-term storage, refrigerate at 2–8°C.</p><p>Reconstituted peptides should be refrigerated and used within 30 days.</p>                    \n                    <h3>\n                                                        What is bacteriostatic water and do I need it?                        \n                    </h3>\n                        <p>Bacteriostatic water (BAC water) is sterile water containing 0.9% benzyl alcohol, used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides. If your peptide requires reconstitution, you can add BAC water to your order.</p>                    \n                    <h3>\n                                                        How long does shipping take?                        \n                    </h3>\n                        <p>Most orders arrive within 1–3 business days within New Zealand. You&#8217;ll receive a tracking number via email<br />once dispatched.</p>','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-03-13 10:22:20','2026-03-12 22:22:20','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?page_id=236',0,'page','',0),(237,1,'2026-03-13 10:04:57','2026-03-12 22:04:57','','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','236-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 10:04:57','2026-03-12 22:04:57','',236,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=237',0,'revision','',0),(238,1,'2026-03-13 10:12:03','2026-03-12 22:12:03','','121dc_undro-