taining 0.9% benzyl alcohol. It is used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides for research purposes.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Are your products for human consumption?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>No. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.</p>','Eterna Peptides','','inherit','closed','closed','','67-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 11:58:32','2026-03-12 23:58:32','',67,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=358',0,'revision','',0),(359,1,'2026-03-13 11:58:32','2026-03-12 23:58:32','<h2>Research-grade peptides for peak performance</h2>		<p>Sourced for purity, tested for potency. Eterna Labs delivers premium research peptides across New Zealand — from recovery and cognitive support to longevity and skin health.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-2