   \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>No. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.</p>','Eterna Peptides','','inherit','closed','closed','','67-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 12:05:23','2026-03-13 00:05:23','',67,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=372',0,'revision','',0),(373,1,'2026-03-13 12:05:23','2026-03-13 00:05:23','<h2>Research-grade peptides for peak performance</h2>		<p>Sourced for purity, tested for potency. Eterna Labs delivers premium research peptides across New Zealand. From recovery and cognitive support to longevity and skin health.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Every vial third-party tested for purity</h2>		<p>98%+ purity guaranteed. Independent HPLC and mass spectrometry testing on every batch. Certificates of analysis available on request.</p>								<a href=\"https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/shop/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n					</a>\n									<h2>Best sellers</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Explore All\n					</a>\n									<h3>Unlock your body’s potential, backed by science, built f