 are a qualified professional researcher or laboratory</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products solely for legitimate research and laboratory testing purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will not resell, redistribute, or use products for human or animal consumption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You understand that our products have not been evaluated or approved by Medsafe or any regulatory body for human use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs reserves the right to refuse or cancel any order where we reasonably believe products may be misused.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. No Medical Claims</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs makes no claims regarding the therapeutic, medicinal, or health benefits of any product. No information on this website should be interpreted as medical advice, a recommendation for treatment, or an endorsement of any research protocol.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website does not promote products for fat loss, muscle gain, anti-ageing treatment, or any other therapeutic outcome. All product categories and descriptions are framed in the context of scientific research only.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Purchase Acknowledgement</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At checkout, all buyers are required to acknowledge that products are sold for laboratory research purposes only. This acknowledgement creates a record of the buyer\'s intent and understanding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Product Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make every effort to ensure product descriptions, images, and specifications on our website are accurate. However, we do not warrant that all information is complete, current, or error-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product images are for illustrative purposes only. Actual product packaging and appearance may vary. Purity percentages are based on third-party testing of specific batches and may vary slightly between batches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Pricing and Payment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All prices are displayed in New Zealand Dollars (NZD) and include GST where applicable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to change prices at any time without notice</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment must be received in full before orders are dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accepted payment methods: Visa/card payments and cryptocurrency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Volume discounts are applied automatically at checkout:</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2 items: 5% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 items: 10% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>5 items: 15% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>10+ items: 20% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Orders and Availability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All orders are subject to availability</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to limit quantities per order</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An order confirmation email does not constitute acceptance of your order — acceptance occurs when the order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We ship to addresses within New Zealand only</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are dispatched within 1-2 business days of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tracking information is provided once the order has been shipped</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs is not responsible for delays caused by customs or postal carriers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery to the shipping address provided</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. All Sales Are Final</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the nature of research compounds, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds once an order has been dispatched.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exceptions are made for orders that arrive damaged (reported within 48 hours with photographic evidence), incorrect orders sent in error, or confirmed lost shipments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Refund Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All content on this website — including text, images, logos, graphics, and software — is the property of Eterna Labs or its licensors and is protected by New Zealand and international intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content without our prior written consent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific product giving rise to the claim</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We are not liable for any outcomes resulting from the use or misuse of our products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The buyer assumes full responsibility for the handling, storage, and use of all products purchased</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability that cannot be limited or excluded under the Consumer Guarantees Act 1993 or any other applicable New Zealand legislation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. Indemnification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Eterna Labs, its directors, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your use or misuse of our products, your breach of these terms, or your violation of any applicable law or regulation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">13. Privacy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your personal information is collected, used, and stored in accordance with our Privacy Policy and the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">14. Governing Law</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">15. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">16. Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Terms & Conditions','','publish','closed','closed','','terms-conditions','','','2026-03-14 10:05:03','2026-03-13 22:05:03','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?page_id=379',0,'page','',0),(380,1,'2026-03-13 12:33:59','2026-03-13 00:33:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Eterna Labs, we stand behind the quality of our products. If something isn\'t right with your order, we\'ll make it right.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Returns</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the nature of research compounds, we have specific conditions for returns:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eligible for return</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unopened, sealed products</strong> may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Products must be in their original packaging and in resaleable condition</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are responsible for return shipping costs unless the return is due to our error</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Not eligible for return</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Opened, unsealed, or reconstituted products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Products that have not been stored in accordance with our storage guidelines</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Products returned after 14 days from delivery</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged or Incorrect Orders</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged or you receive the wrong product:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Contact us within 48 hours</strong> of delivery at hello@eternlabs.co.nz</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Include photos</strong> of the damage or incorrect item</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include your <strong>order number</strong> in your email</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will either replace the item or issue a full refund at no extra cost to you. You will not need to return the damaged product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Request a Return</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Email us at hello@eternlabs.co.nz with your order number and reason for return</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We will provide return instructions and a return authorisation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ship the product back to us using a tracked courier service</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Once we receive and inspect the product, we will process your refund</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Please do not return products without first contacting us.</strong> Unauthorised returns may not be processed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Refund Processing</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refunds are processed within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> after we receive and inspect the returned product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refunds are issued to the original payment method</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will receive an email confirmation when your refund has been processed</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Depending on your bank or payment provider, it may take an additional 2–5 business days for the refund to appear in your account</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancellations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders may be cancelled for a full refund if they have not yet been dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Once an order has been dispatched, it cannot be cancelled — please follow the returns process above</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exceptions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs reserves the right to refuse a return or refund if:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The product has been opened, tampered with, or reconstituted</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The product has not been stored correctly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The return is requested outside the 14-day window</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reasonably believe the return policy is being abused</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consumer Guarantees Act</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in this policy limits your rights under the New Zealand Consumer Guarantees Act 1993.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any questions about returns or refunds:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternlabs.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Refund Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','378-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 12:33:59','2026-03-13 00:33:59','',378,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=380',0,'revision','',0),(381,1,'2026-03-13 12:34:22','2026-03-13 00:34:22','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Areas</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We currently ship within <strong>New Zealand only</strong>. International shipping is not available at this time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Processing Time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are processed and dispatched within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next business day</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will receive a confirmation email with tracking information once your order has been dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery Times</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Shipping Method</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Availability</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Standard Shipping</strong></td><td>1–3 business days</td><td>All NZ addresses</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Express Shipping</strong></td><td>Next business day</td><td>Most NZ addresses</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delivery times are estimates and are not guaranteed. Factors such as courier delays, weather, or remote locations may affect delivery times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Costs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on your delivery address and selected shipping method.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order Tracking</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A tracking number is emailed to you once your order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can track your order using the link provided in the shipping confirmation email</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can also check your order status in your account dashboard on our website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Packaging</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All orders are shipped in <strong>discreet, unmarked packaging</strong> with no external branding or product descriptions visible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Temperature-sensitive products are shipped with appropriate cold-chain packaging to maintain product integrity during transit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cold-Chain Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Certain peptide products require temperature-controlled shipping. These orders are packed with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Insulated packaging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gel ice packs where required</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sealed protective containers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We recommend retrieving your delivery promptly and refrigerating products as soon as possible upon receipt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery Issues</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order not received</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order has not arrived within the estimated delivery timeframe:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check your tracking link for the latest status</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact us at hello@eternlabs.co.nz with your order number</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We will investigate with the courier and resolve the issue</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect delivery address</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please ensure your shipping address is correct at checkout. We are not responsible for orders delivered to incorrect addresses provided by the customer. If an order is returned to us due to an incorrect address, we will contact you to arrange reshipment (additional shipping charges may apply).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged in transit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged, contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Unsuccessful Delivery</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a courier delivery is unsuccessful, the courier will leave a card with instructions for collection or redelivery. If the parcel is returned to us, we will contact you to arrange reshipment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any shipping enquiries:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternlabs.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Shipping Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 12:34:22','2026-03-13 00:34:22','',10,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=381',0,'revision','',0),(382,1,'2026-03-13 12:34:36','2026-03-13 00:34:36','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Introduction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Eterna Labs website (eternlabs.co.nz) and any purchases made through it. By accessing this website or placing an order, you agree to be bound by these terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs is a New Zealand-based supplier of research-grade peptides and related accessories.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Research Use Only</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All products sold by Eterna Labs are intended strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption, veterinary use, or any therapeutic application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing from Eterna Labs, you confirm that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products solely for legitimate research purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will not resell products for human or animal consumption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You understand that our products are not approved by Medsafe or any regulatory body for therapeutic use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs reserves the right to refuse or cancel any order where we reasonably believe products may be misused.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Product Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make every effort to ensure product descriptions, images, and specifications on our website are accurate. However, we do not warrant that all information is complete, current, or error-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product images are for illustrative purposes only. Actual product packaging and appearance may vary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Pricing and Payment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All prices are displayed in New Zealand Dollars (NZD) and include GST where applicable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to change prices at any time without notice</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment must be received in full before orders are dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Volume discounts (10% off 2+ items, 15% off 3+ items) are applied automatically at checkout</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Orders and Availability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All orders are subject to availability</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to limit quantities per order</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An order confirmation email does not constitute acceptance of your order — acceptance occurs when the order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We ship to addresses within New Zealand only</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Standard delivery is 1–3 business days via tracked courier</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery to the shipping address provided</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Returns and Refunds</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products due to the nature of research compounds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Damaged items must be reported within 48 hours of delivery with photographic evidence</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Refund Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All content on this website — including text, images, logos, graphics, and software — is the property of Eterna Labs or its licensors and is protected by New Zealand and international intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content without our prior written consent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific product giving rise to the claim</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We are not liable for any outcomes resulting from the use of our products in research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability that cannot be limited or excluded under the Consumer Guarantees Act 1993 or any other applicable New Zealand legislation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Privacy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your personal information is collected, used, and stored in accordance with our Privacy Policy and the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Governing Law</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">13. Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternlabs.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Terms & Conditions','','inherit','closed','closed','','379-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 12:34:36','2026-03-13 00:34:36','',379,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=382',0,'revision','',0),(384,1,'2026-03-13 12:36:52','2026-03-13 00:36:52','<h1>ETERNA</h1>					\n        <form method=\"post\" name=\"New Form\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"widget_id\" value=\"973c34d\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"widget_type\" value=\"newsletter\">\n                                            <label for=\"form-field-email\">\n                            Sign up for our newsletter                        </label>\n                                        <input type=\"text\" size=\"1\" name=\"form_fields[email]\" id=\"form-fields-email\" placeholder=\"Your email here\">\n                        <label for=\"form-field-address\">\n                            Address                        </label>\n                        <input name=\"ui-e-h-p\" id=\"ui-e-h-p\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n                    <button type=\"submit\">\n                                                                                                                Submit\n                    </button>\n        </form>\n					<h4>The Ultimate Style Haven for Fashion Enthusias