level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Non-delivery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order does not arrive within 7 business days of the estimated delivery date, contact us and we will investigate with the courier. If the order is confirmed lost, we will reship or refund in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancellations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Orders may be cancelled for a full refund <strong>only if they have not yet been dispatched</strong>. Once an order has been dispatched, it cannot be cancelled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To request a cancellation, email us at hello@eternlabs.co.nz with your order number as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consumer Guarantees Act</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in this policy limits your rights under the New Zealand Consumer Guarantees Act 1993. Where a product is faulty, damaged, or not as described, your statutory rights apply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any order issues:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Refund Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','378-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:08:27','2026-03-13 01:08:27','',378,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=428',0,'revision','',0),(429,1,'2026-03-13 13:08:48','2026-03-13 01:08:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Introduction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Eterna Labs website (eternlabs.co.nz) and any purchases made through it. By accessing this website or placing an order, you agree to be bound by these terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs is a New Zealand-based supplier of research-grade peptides and related accessories.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Research Use Only</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All products sold by Eterna Labs are intended strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption, veterinary use, or any therapeutic application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing from Eterna Labs, you confirm that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products solely for legitimate research purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will not resell products for human or animal consumption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You understand that our products are not approved by Medsafe or any regulatory body for therapeutic use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs reserves the right to refuse or cancel any order where we reasonably believe products may be misused.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Product Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make every effort to ensure product descriptions, images, and specifications on our website are accurate. However, we do not warrant that all information is complete, current, or error-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product images are for illustrative purposes only. Actual product packaging and appearance may vary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Pricing and Payment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All prices are displayed in New Zealand Dollars (NZD) and include GST where applicable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to change prices at any time without notice</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment must be received in full before orders are dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Volume discounts (10% off 2+ items, 15% off 3+ items) are applied automatically at checkout</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Orders and Availability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All orders are subject to availability</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to limit quantities per order</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An order confirmation email does not constitute acceptance of your order — acceptance occurs when the order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We ship to addresses within New Zealand only</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Standard delivery is 1–3 business days via tracked courier</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery to the shipping address provided</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Returns and Refunds</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products due to the nature of research compounds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Damaged items must be reported within 48 hours of delivery with photographic evidence</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Refund Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All content on this website — including text, images, logos, graphics, and software — is the property of Eterna Labs or its licensors and is protected by New Zealand and international intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content without our prior written consent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific product giving rise to the claim</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We are not liable for any outcomes resulting from the use of our products in research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability that cannot be limited or excluded under the Consumer Guarantees Act 1993 or any other applicable New Zealand legislation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Privacy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your personal information is collected, used, and stored in accordance with our Privacy Policy and the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Governing Law</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">13. Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Terms & Conditions','','inherit','closed','closed','','379-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:08:48','2026-03-13 01:08:48','',379,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=429',0,'revision','',0),(430,1,'2026-03-13 13:08:55','2026-03-13 01:08:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Areas</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We currently ship within <strong>New Zealand only</strong>. International shipping is not available at this time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Processing Time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are processed and dispatched within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next business day</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will receive a confirmation email with tracking information once your order has been dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery Times</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Shipping Method</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Availability</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Standard Shipping</strong></td><td>1–3 business days</td><td>All NZ addresses</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Express Shipping</strong></td><td>Next business day</td><td>Most NZ addresses</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delivery times are estimates and are not guaranteed. Factors such as courier delays, weather, or remote locations may affect delivery times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Costs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on your delivery address and selected shipping method.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order Tracking</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A tracking number is emailed to you once your order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can track your order using the link provided in the shipping confirmation email</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can also check your order status in your account dashboard on our website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Packaging</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All orders are shipped in <strong>discreet, unmarked packaging</strong> with no external branding or product descriptions visible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Temperature-sensitive products are shipped with appropriate cold-chain packaging to maintain product integrity during transit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cold-Chain Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Certain peptide products require temperature-controlled shipping. These orders are packed with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Insulated packaging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gel ice packs where required</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sealed protective containers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We recommend retrieving your delivery promptly and refrigerating products as soon as possible upon receipt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery Issues</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order not received</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order has not arrived within the estimated delivery timeframe:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check your tracking link for the latest status</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact us at hello@eternapeptides.co.nz with your order number</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We will investigate with the courier and resolve the issue</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect delivery address</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please ensure your shipping address is correct at checkout. We are not responsible for orders delivered to incorrect addresses provided by the customer. If an order is returned to us due to an incorrect address, we will contact you to arrange reshipment (additional shipping charges may apply).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged in transit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged, contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Unsuccessful Delivery</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a courier delivery is unsuccessful, the courier will leave a card with instructions for collection or redelivery. If the parcel is returned to us, we will contact you to arrange reshipment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any shipping enquiries:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Shipping Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:08:55','2026-03-13 01:08:55','',10,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=430',0,'revision','',0),(431,1,'2026-03-13 13:09:07','2026-03-13 01:09:07','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">All Sales Are Final</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the nature of research compounds, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds once an order has been dispatched.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy exists to protect the integrity of our products. Once a product leaves our facility, we cannot verify that it has been stored or handled correctly, and we cannot resell it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exceptions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will replace or refund your order in the following circumstances:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged in transit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Contact us within 48 hours</strong> of delivery at hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Include photos</strong> of the damaged product and packaging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include your <strong>order number</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect order</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you receive the wrong product, contact us with your order number and a photo of what you received. We will send the correct product at no additional charge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Non-delivery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order does not arrive within 7 business days of the estimated delivery date, contact us and we will investigate with the courier. If the order is confirmed lost, we will reship or refund in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancellations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Orders may be cancelled for a full refund <strong>only if they have not yet been dispatched</strong>. Once an order has been dispatched, it cannot be cancelled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To request a cancellation, email us at hello@eternapeptides.co.nz with your order number as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consumer Guarantees Act</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in this policy limits your rights under the New Zealand Consumer Guarantees Act 1993. Where a product is faulty, damaged, or not as described, your statutory rights apply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any order issues:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Refund Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','378-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:09:07','2026-03-13 01:09:07','',378,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=431',0,'revision','',0),(432,1,'2026-03-13 13:09:17','2026-03-13 01:09:17','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Introduction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and disclose your personal information in accordance with the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Information We Collect</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Information you provide to us</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Account information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, shipping address, billing address</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Order information:</strong> Products purchased, order history, payment details (processed securely through our payment provider — we do not store card numbers)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Communications:</strong> Emails, contact form submissions, and any other correspondence with us</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Information collected automatically</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Website usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent on pages, referring URLs, browser type, device type</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cookies and tracking:</strong> We use cookies and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and analyse website performance (see Section 7)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>IP address:</strong> Collected for security and analytics purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use your personal information to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Process and fulfil your orders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Send order confirmations, shipping notifications, and tracking information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Respond to your enquiries and provide customer support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve our website, products, and services</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Send marketing communications (only with your consent — you can opt out at any time)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comply with legal obligations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prevent fraud and maintain website security</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Shipping providers:</strong> To deliver your orders (e.g., courier companies)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Payment processors:</strong> To process your transactions securely</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Analytics providers:</strong> To help us understand website usage (e.g., Google Analytics)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Legal authorities:</strong> Where required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All third-party service providers are required to handle your information in accordance with applicable privacy laws.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Data Storage and Security</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your personal information is stored on secure servers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We use industry-standard security measures including encryption, firewalls, and secure access controls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Despite our best efforts, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure — we cannot guarantee absolute security</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Your Rights</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020, you have the right to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Access</strong> your personal information held by us</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Request correction</strong> of any inaccurate or incomplete information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your personal information (subject to legal obligations we may have to retain certain records)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> for marketing communications at any time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at hello@eternapeptides.co.nz.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website uses cookies to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remember your preferences and cart contents</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Analyse website traffic and performance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide a personalised browsing experience</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect the functionality of our website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of cookies we use</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function (cart, checkout, login)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors use our website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Marketing cookies:</strong> Used to deliver relevant advertisements (only if you consent)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Third-Party Links</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Children\'s Privacy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website and products are not intended for anyone under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Contact Us</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, or wish to make a privacy-related request, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Office of the Privacy Commissioner: <a href=\"https://www.privacy.org.nz\">privacy.org.nz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','375-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:09:17','2026-03-13 01:09:17','',375,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=432',0,'revision','',0),(433,1,'2026-03-13 13:09:22','2026-03-13 01:09:22','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last updated: March 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Research Use Only</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All products sold by Eterna Labs are strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption, veterinary use, food additives, household use, or any therapeutic or diagnostic application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our products are not medicines, supplements, or food products.</strong> They have not been evaluated or approved by Medsafe, the New Zealand Food Safety Authority, or any other regulatory body for human use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">No Medical Claims</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs makes no claims regarding the therapeutic, medicinal, or health benefits of any product we sell. Any information provided on our website — including product descriptions, blog posts, and educational content — is for informational and research reference purposes only.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing on this website should be interpreted as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Medical advice</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A recommendation for the treatment, cure, or prevention of any disease or condition</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An endorsement of any specific research protocol</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A suggestion that any product is safe or effective for human use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buyer Responsibility</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing from Eterna Labs, you acknowledge and agree that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You have the necessary knowledge, training, and qualifications to handle research peptides safely</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products exclusively for legitimate research and laboratory purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will comply with all applicable New Zealand laws and regulations regarding the purchase, possession, and use of research compounds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You assume full responsibility for the handling, storage, and use of any products purchased</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accuracy of Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While we strive to ensure all information on our website is accurate and up to date, we make no representations or warranties — express or implied — about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or suitability of any information, products, or services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product specifications, including purity percentages, are based on third-party testing of specific batches and may vary slightly between batches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law, Eterna Labs and its directors, employees, and agents shall not be held liable for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any adverse effects, injury, loss, or damage resulting from the misuse of our products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any reliance on information provided on our website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the purchase or use of our products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Third-Party Content</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website may contain references to third-party research, studies, or publications. These are provided for informational purposes only and do not constitute an endorsement of the findings or conclusions of those studies. We encourage independent verification of all research referenced.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indemnification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Eterna Labs from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your use or misuse of our products, your breach of these terms, or your violation of any applicable law or regulation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">New Zealand Law</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This disclaimer is governed by the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about this disclaimer, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: hello@eternapeptides.co.nz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:preformatted -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">Disclaimer</pre>\n<!-- /wp:preformatted -->','Disclaimer','','inherit','closed','closed','','374-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 13:09:22','2026-03-13 01:09:22','',374,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=433',0,'revision','',0),(434,1,'2026-03-14 09:37:04','2026-03-13 21:37:04','','Untitled (1080 x 1080 px)','','inherit','open','closed','','untitled-1080-x-1080-px','','','2026-03-14 09:37:04','2026-03-13 21:37:04','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-1080-x-1080-px.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(435,1,'2026-03-14 09:37:24','