 aria-controls=\"ui-e-tab-content-1224\" style=\"--ui-e-tabs-order: 4;\">\n                                     Product &amp; Quality \n        </button>\n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What are research peptides?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Peptides are short chains of amino acids that play key roles in biological processes. Our peptides are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Are your peptides third-party tested?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. Every batch is independently tested for purity (minimum 98%) and identity via HPLC and mass spectrometry. Certificates of analysis are available on request.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you ship throughout New Zealand?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>We offer fast, discreet shipping across all of New Zealand. Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days with tracked courier delivery.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you offer volume discounts?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. Orders of 2+ items receive 10% off, and 3+ items receive 15% off automatically at checkout.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        How long does shipping take?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Most orders arrive within 1–3 business days within New Zealand. You will receive a tracking number via email once your order is dispatched.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you offer express shipping?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes, express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Can I track my order?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Absolutely. A tracking link is emailed to you as soon as your order ships. You can also check your order status in your account dashboard.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you ship internationally?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Currently we only ship within New Zealand. International shipping is being evaluated for future release.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What is your return policy?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Due to the nature of research compounds, we cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products. Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What if my order arrives damaged?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no extra cost.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        How long do refunds take?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Refunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Can I return a reconstituted peptide?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        No. Once a peptide has been reconstituted (mixed with bacteriostatic water), it cannot be returned due to contamination and integrity concerns.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What purity are your peptides?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>All Eterna Labs peptides are a minimum of 98% purity, verified by independent HPLC testing.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you provide Certificates of Analysis?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. COAs are available for every batch. Contact us with your order number and we will send the relevant certificate.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What is bacteriostatic water used for?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Bacteriostatic water (BAC water) is sterile water containing 0.9% benzyl alcohol. It is used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides for research purposes.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Are your products for human consumption?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>No. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What are research peptides?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Peptides are short chains of amino acids that play key roles in biological processes. Our peptides are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not intended for human consumption.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Are your peptides third-party tested?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. Every batch is independently tested for purity (minimum 98%) and identity via HPLC and mass spectrometry. Certificates of analysis are available on request.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you ship throughout New Zealand?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>We offer fast, discreet shipping across all of New Zealand. Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days with tracked courier delivery.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you offer volume discounts?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. Orders of 2+ items receive 10% off, and 3+ items receive 15% off automatically at checkout.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        How long does shipping take?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Most orders arrive within 1–3 business days within New Zealand. You will receive a tracking number via email once your order is dispatched.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you offer express shipping?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes, express shipping is available at checkout for next-business-day delivery to most NZ addresses.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Can I track my order?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Absolutely. A tracking link is emailed to you as soon as your order ships. You can also check your order status in your account dashboard.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you ship internationally?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Currently we only ship within New Zealand. International shipping is being evaluated for future release.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What is your return policy?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Due to the nature of research compounds, we cannot accept returns on opened or reconstituted products. Unopened, sealed products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a full refund.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What if my order arrives damaged?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no extra cost.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        How long do refunds take?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        Refunds are processed within 3–5 business days after we receive and inspect the returned product.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Can I return a reconstituted peptide?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        No. Once a peptide has been reconstituted (mixed with bacteriostatic water), it cannot be returned due to contamination and integrity concerns.                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What purity are your peptides?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>All Eterna Labs peptides are a minimum of 98% purity, verified by independent HPLC testing.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Do you provide Certificates of Analysis?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Yes. COAs are available for every batch. Contact us with your order number and we will send the relevant certificate.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        What is bacteriostatic water used for?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>Bacteriostatic water (BAC water) is sterile water containing 0.9% benzyl alcohol. It is used to reconstitute lyophilised (freeze-dried) peptides for research purposes.</p>                    \n                    <h5>\n                                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                \n                                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>                                    \n                                                        Are your products for human consumption?                        \n                    </h5>\n                        <p>No. All Eterna Labs products are sold strictly for research and laboratory use only. They are not approved for human consumption.</p>','Eterna Peptides','','inherit','closed','closed','','67-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 09:37:53','2026-03-13 21:37:53','',67,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=441',0,'revision','',0),(442,1,'2026-03-14 09:39:22','2026-03-13 21:39:22','','Untitled (1080 x 1080 px)','','inherit','open','closed','','untitled-1080-x-1080-px-2','','','2026-03-14 09:39:22','2026-03-13 21:39:22','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-1080-x-1080-px-1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(443,1,'2026-03-14 09:40:48','2026-03-13 21:40:48','<p>Melanotan II (MT-II) is a synthetic cyclic heptapeptide analogue of alpha-melanocyte-stimulating hormone, acting as a non-selective agonist at melanocortin receptors (MC1R, MC3R, MC4R, MC5R), studied in pigmentation biology, melanocortin receptor research, and central nervous system studies.</p>\n<p>Published studies document MT-II\'s stimulation of eumelanin synthesis at MC1R through cAMP-mediated tyrosinase activation, making it a widely used tool compound in pigmentation research. Separate literature investigates its MC4R activity in hypothalamic nuclei, with rodent studies examining food intake and cardiovascular parameters. MC3R activity has been explored in inflammatory and immune cell signalling models. MT-II is light-sensitive; reconstituted solutions should be handled under low-light conditions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Amount per vial:</strong> 10mg lyophilised powder</li>\n<li>Lyophilised powder; reconstitute with bacteriostatic water</li>\n<li>Store at -20°C pre-reconstitution; 2-8°C post-reconstitution; use within 28 days</li>\n<li>Third-party tested by Janoshik Analytical (min. purity 98%+)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For laboratory research use only.</p>','Melanotan II 10mg','','publish','open','closed','','melanotan-ii-10mg','','','2026-04-07 01:12:41','2026-04-06 13:12:41','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/product/melanotan-ii-10mg/',0,'product','',0),(445,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:02','2026-03-13 22:05:02','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Introduction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Eterna Labs website (eternapeptides.co.nz) and any purchases made through it. By accessing this website or placing an order, you agree to be bound by these terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs is a New Zealand-based supplier of research-grade peptides and laboratory supplies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Research Use Only</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All products sold by Eterna Labs are intended for laboratory research purposes only. They are not intended for human consumption, therapeutic use, diagnostic use, veterinary use, or any other non-research application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing from Eterna Labs, you confirm that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are a qualified professional researcher or laboratory</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products solely for legitimate research and laboratory testing purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will not resell, redistribute, or use products for human or animal consumption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You understand that our products have not been evaluated or approved by Medsafe or any regulatory body for human use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs reserves the right to refuse or cancel any order where we reasonably believe products may be misused.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. No Medical Claims</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs makes no claims regarding the therapeutic, medicinal, or health benefits of any product. No information on this website should be interpreted as medical advice, a recommendation for treatment, or an endorsement of any research protocol.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website does not promote products for fat loss, muscle gain, anti-ageing treatment, or any other therapeutic outcome. All product categories and descriptions are framed in the context of scientific research only.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Purchase Acknowledgement</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At checkout, all buyers are required to acknowledge that products are sold for laboratory research purposes only. This acknowledgement creates a record of the buyer\'s intent and understanding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Product Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make every effort to ensure product descriptions, images, and specifications on our website are accurate. However, we do not warrant that all information is complete, current, or error-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product images are for illustrative purposes only. Actual product packaging and appearance may vary. Purity percentages are based on third-party testing of specific batches and may vary slightly between batches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Pricing and Payment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All prices are displayed in New Zealand Dollars (NZD) and include GST where applicable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to change prices at any time without notice</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment must be received in full before orders are dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accepted payment methods: Visa/card payments and cryptocurrency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Volume discounts are applied automatically at checkout:</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2 items: 5% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 items: 10% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>5 items: 15% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>10+ items: 20% off</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Orders and Availability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All orders are subject to availability</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to limit quantities per order</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An order confirmation email does not constitute acceptance of your order — acceptance occurs when the order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Shipping</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We ship to addresses within New Zealand only</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are dispatched within 1-2 business days of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tracking information is provided once the order has been shipped</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs is not responsible for delays caused by customs or postal carriers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery to the shipping address provided</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. All Sales Are Final</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the nature of research compounds, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds once an order has been dispatched.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exceptions are made for orders that arrive damaged (reported within 48 hours with photographic evidence), incorrect orders sent in error, or confirmed lost shipments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For full details, see our Refund Policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All content on this website — including text, images, logos, graphics, and software — is the property of Eterna Labs or its licensors and is protected by New Zealand and international intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content without our prior written consent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eterna Labs shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific product giving rise to the claim</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We are not liable for any outcomes resulting from the use or misuse of our products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The buyer assumes full responsibility for the handling, storage, and use of all products purchased</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability that cannot be limited or excluded under the Consumer Guarantees Act 1993 or any other applicable New Zealand legislation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. Indemnification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Eterna Labs, its directors, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your use or misuse of our products, your breach of these terms, or your violation of any applicable law or regulation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">13. Privacy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your personal information is collected, used, and stored in accordance with our Privacy Policy and the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">14. Governing Law</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">15. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">16. Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Terms & Conditions','','inherit','closed','closed','','379-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:02','2026-03-13 22:05:02','',379,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=445',0,'revision','',0),(446,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:50','2026-03-13 22:05:50','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Eterna Labs, transparency is non-negotiable. Every peptide we sell is independently tested by Janoshik Analytical — the gold standard in European peptide testing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below you will find the Certificate of Analysis for each product batch, including compound name, batch number, purity percentage, test date, and the full lab report.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Read a COA</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each Certificate of Analysis includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Compound Name</strong> — the peptide tested</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Batch Number</strong> — the specific production batch</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Purity Percentage</strong> — verified via HPLC testing (all Eterna Labs peptides are minimum 98%+ purity)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Test Date</strong> — when the independent testing was conducted</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Lab Report (PDF)</strong> — the full analytical report from Janoshik Analytical</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Test Results</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Results will be published as testing is completed for each batch. Check back regularly for updates.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Compound</th><th>Batch #</th><th>Purity</th><th>Test Date</th><th>Report</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Coming soon</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">QR Code Verification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each Eterna Labs product box will include a QR code that links directly to the testing results for that specific batch. Scan the code on your product packaging to verify authenticity and purity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>QR code verification is currently being rolled out and will be available on all products in the near future.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Independent Testing Matters</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most peptide suppliers either don\'t test their products or rely on in-house testing from the manufacturer. Eterna Labs uses Janoshik Analytical — an independent European laboratory trusted by the research community worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each test costs approximately $500 NZD per compound. We test every peptide because your research depends on it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you would like to request a COA for a specific product or batch, contact us at eternalabsnz@gmail.com with your order number and product name.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Certificate of Analysis (COA)','','publish','closed','closed','','certificate-of-analysis-coa','','','2026-03-14 10:05:50','2026-03-13 22:05:50','',0,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?page_id=446',0,'page','',0),(447,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:16','2026-03-13 22:05:16','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">For Laboratory Research Use Only</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All products sold by Eterna Labs are intended for laboratory research purposes only. They are not for human consumption, therapeutic use, or diagnostic use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing any product from Eterna Labs, the customer acknowledges that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The product is intended solely for research and laboratory testing purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The buyer represents and warrants that they are a qualified professional researcher or laboratory</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The buyer will use the product in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The buyer assumes full responsibility for the proper handling, storage, and use of the product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">No Medical or Therapeutic Claims</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs does not make any claims regarding the therapeutic, medicinal, or health benefits of any product sold on this website. Our products have not been evaluated or approved by Medsafe, the New Zealand Food Safety Authority, or any other regulatory body for human use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing on this website — including product descriptions, blog posts, research summaries, and educational content — should be interpreted as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Medical advice or a medical recommendation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A claim that any product can treat, cure, or prevent any disease or condition</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An endorsement of any specific research protocol or application</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A suggestion that any product is safe or effective for human or animal use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All product categories on this website (e.g., \"Metabolic Research Peptides\", \"Regenerative Research Peptides\", \"Cognitive / Nootropic Peptides\") refer to the area of scientific research the compound is associated with — not therapeutic applications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buyer Responsibility</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By purchasing from Eterna Labs, you acknowledge and agree that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You have the necessary knowledge, training, and qualifications to handle research peptides and laboratory compounds safely</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will use all products exclusively for legitimate research and laboratory purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will comply with all applicable New Zealand laws and regulations regarding the purchase, possession, and use of research compounds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You will not resell, redistribute, or provide products for human or animal consumption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You assume full responsibility and liability for any and all use of products purchased from Eterna Labs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Purchase Acknowledgement</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All buyers are required to confirm at checkout that they understand products are sold for laboratory research purposes only. This acknowledgement is a condition of purchase and creates a record of the buyer\'s intent and understanding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Third-Party Research</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website may contain references to third-party research, studies, or publications. These are provided for informational and educational purposes only and do not constitute an endorsement of the findings, conclusions, or applications described in those studies. We encourage independent verification of all referenced research.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law, Eterna Labs and its directors, employees, and agents shall not be held liable for any adverse effects, injury, loss, or damage resulting from the use or misuse of any product purchased from this website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indemnification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Eterna Labs from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your use or misuse of our products, your breach of these terms, or your violation of any applicable law or regulation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Product Labelling</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All Eterna Labs products carry the following label:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>\"For laboratory research use only. Not for human consumption.\"</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This label applies to all products without exception.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions about this disclaimer, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Research Use Disclaimer','','inherit','closed','closed','','374-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:16','2026-03-13 22:05:16','',374,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=447',0,'revision','',0),(448,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:24','2026-03-13 22:05:24','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Introduction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and disclose your personal information in accordance with the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Information We Collect</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Information you provide to us</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Account information:</strong> Name, email address, shipping address, billing address</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Order information:</strong> Products purchased, order history, payment details (processed securely through our payment providers — we do not store card numbers or cryptocurrency wallet addresses)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Communications:</strong> Emails, contact form submissions, and any other correspondence with us</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Information collected automatically</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Website usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent on pages, referring URLs, browser type, device type</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cookies and tracking:</strong> We use cookies and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and analyse website performance (see Section 7)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>IP address:</strong> Collected for security and analytics purposes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use your personal information to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Process and fulfil your orders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Send order confirmations, shipping notifications, and tracking information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Respond to your enquiries and provide customer support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve our website, products, and services</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comply with legal obligations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prevent fraud and maintain website security</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not send marketing communications unless you have explicitly opted in. You can opt out at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Shipping providers:</strong> To deliver your orders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Payment processors:</strong> To process card and cryptocurrency transactions securely</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Analytics providers:</strong> To help us understand website usage (e.g., Google Analytics)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Legal authorities:</strong> Where required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All third-party service providers are required to handle your information in accordance with applicable privacy laws.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Data Storage and Security</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your personal information is stored on secure servers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We use industry-standard security measures including encryption, firewalls, and secure access controls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment information is processed by third-party payment providers and is not stored on our servers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Despite our best efforts, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure — we cannot guarantee absolute security</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Your Rights</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020, you have the right to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Access</strong> your personal information held by us</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Request correction</strong> of any inaccurate or incomplete information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your personal information (subject to legal obligations we may have to retain certain records)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> for any optional communications at any time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at eternalabsnz@gmail.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website uses cookies to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remember your preferences and cart contents</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Analyse website traffic and performance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide a functional browsing experience</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect the functionality of our website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of cookies we use</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function (cart, checkout, login)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors use our website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Third-Party Links</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Age Requirement</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website and products are intended for adults aged 18 and over only. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under the age of 18.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Contact Us</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, or wish to make a privacy-related request, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Office of the Privacy Commissioner: <a href=\"https://www.privacy.org.nz\">privacy.org.nz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','375-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:24','2026-03-13 22:05:24','',375,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=448',0,'revision','',0),(449,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:33','2026-03-13 22:05:33','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">All Sales Are Final</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the nature of research chemicals, all products cannot be returned once shipped. All sales are final.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy exists to protect the integrity of our products. Once a product leaves our facility, we cannot verify that it has been stored or handled correctly, and we cannot resell it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exceptions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will replace or refund your order in the following circumstances:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged in transit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Contact us within 48 hours</strong> of delivery at eternalabsnz@gmail.com</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Include photos</strong> of the damaged product and packaging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include your <strong>order number</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect order</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you receive the wrong product, contact us with your order number and a photo of what you received. We will send the correct product at no additional charge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Non-delivery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order does not arrive and is confirmed lost by the courier, we will reship or refund in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancellations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Orders may be cancelled for a full refund <strong>only if they have not yet been dispatched</strong>. Once an order has been dispatched, it cannot be cancelled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To request a cancellation, email us at eternalabsnz@gmail.com with your order number as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consumer Guarantees Act</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing in this policy limits your rights under the New Zealand Consumer Guarantees Act 1993. Where a product is faulty, damaged, or not as described, your statutory rights apply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any order issues:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Refund & Returns Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','378-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:33','2026-03-13 22:05:33','',378,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=449',0,'revision','',0),(450,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:46','2026-03-13 22:05:46','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Areas</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We currently ship within <strong>New Zealand only</strong>. International shipping is not available at this time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Processing Time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders are typically processed within <strong>1-2 business days</strong> of payment confirmation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next business day</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tracking information will be provided once the order has been shipped</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All orders are shipped via tracked courier within New Zealand. Delivery times vary depending on your location and the shipping method selected at checkout.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order Tracking</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A tracking number is emailed to you once your order is dispatched</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can track your order using the link provided in the shipping confirmation email</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can also check your order status in your account dashboard</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Packaging</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All orders are shipped in <strong>discreet, unmarked packaging</strong> with no external branding or product descriptions visible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Temperature-sensitive products are shipped with appropriate cold-chain packaging to maintain product integrity during transit. We recommend retrieving your delivery promptly and refrigerating products as soon as possible upon receipt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery Issues</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order not received</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order has not arrived within a reasonable timeframe after dispatch:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check your tracking link for the latest status</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact us at eternalabsnz@gmail.com with your order number</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>We will investigate with the courier and resolve the issue</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect delivery address</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please ensure your shipping address is correct at checkout. Eterna Labs is not responsible for orders delivered to incorrect addresses provided by the customer. If an order is returned to us due to an incorrect address, we will contact you to arrange reshipment (additional shipping charges may apply).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Damaged in transit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged, contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage. We will replace the item or issue a full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lost packages</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eterna Labs is not responsible for delays caused by customs or postal carriers. If a package is confirmed lost by the courier, we will reship or refund in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Unsuccessful Delivery</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a courier delivery is unsuccessful, the courier will leave a card with instructions for collection or redelivery. If the parcel is returned to us, we will contact you to arrange reshipment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For any shipping enquiries:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eterna Labs</strong><br>Email: eternalabsnz@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Shipping Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:46','2026-03-13 22:05:46','',10,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=450',0,'revision','',0),(451,1,'2026-03-14 10:05:50','2026-03-13 22:05:50','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Eterna Labs, transparency is non-negotiable. Every peptide we sell is independently tested by Janoshik Analytical — the gold standard in European peptide testing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below you will find the Certificate of Analysis for each product batch, including compound name, batch number, purity percentage, test date, and the full lab report.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Read a COA</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each Certificate of Analysis includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Compound Name</strong> — the peptide tested</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Batch Number</strong> — the specific production batch</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Purity Percentage</strong> — verified via HPLC testing (all Eterna Labs peptides are minimum 98%+ purity)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Test Date</strong> — when the independent testing was conducted</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Lab Report (PDF)</strong> — the full analytical report from Janoshik Analytical</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Test Results</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Results will be published as testing is completed for each batch. Check back regularly for updates.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Compound</th><th>Batch #</th><th>Purity</th><th>Test Date</th><th>Report</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Coming soon</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">QR Code Verification</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each Eterna Labs product box will include a QR code that links directly to the testing results for that specific batch. Scan the code on your product packaging to verify authenticity and purity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>QR code verification is currently being rolled out and will be available on all products in the near future.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Independent Testing Matters</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most peptide suppliers either don\'t test their products or rely on in-house testing from the manufacturer. Eterna Labs uses Janoshik Analytical — an independent European laboratory trusted by the research community worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each test costs approximately $500 NZD per compound. We test every peptide because your research depends on it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you would like to request a COA for a specific product or batch, contact us at eternalabsnz@gmail.com with your order number and product name.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Certificate of Analysis (COA)','','inherit','closed','closed','','446-revision-v1','','','2026-03-14 10:05:50','2026-03-13 22:05:50','',446,'https://woocommerce-1174581-6265451.cloudwaysapps.com/?p=451',0,'revision','',0),(452,1,'2026-03-14 10:06:24','2026-03-13 22:06:24','<h1>ETERNA</h1>					\n        <form method=\"post\" name=\"Newsletter\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"widget_id\" value=\"973c34d\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"widget_type\" value=\"newsletter\">\n                                            <label for=\"form-field-email\">\n                            Sign up for our newsletter                        </label>\n                                        <input type=\"text\" size=\"1\" name=\"form_fields[email]\" id=\"form-fields-email\" placeholder=\"Your email here\">\n                        <label for=\"form-field-address\">\n                            Address                        </label>\n                        <input name=\"ui-e-h-p\" id=\"ui-e-h-p\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n                    <button type=\"submit\">\n                                                                                        Subscribe\n                    </button>\n        </form>\n					<h4>Sourced for purity, tested for potency. Eterna Labs delivers premium research peptides across New Zealand. From recovery and cognitive